+### §viewport-media-query — the shell's layout step follows the viewport
+- Since: 2026-10-23
+- Decision: the shell's layout step is a plain viewport `@media (min-width: 720px)` query. `.shell` is no longer a
+  query container (`container-type` removed).
+- Overrides: §container-not-viewport (since 2026-09-15), which required `@container` queries on `.shell` and forbade
+  viewport `@media` width queries. The maintainer overrode it on 2026-10-23.
+- Known risk: the override brings back the condition behind incident 2026-09-14. The shell renders inside split panes
+  as narrow as 380px on a 1440px screen, and a viewport query picks the two-column layout there and clips the
+  sidebar.
